# them to this repo's .prettierrc (4-space TOML, no-tabs JSON) puts the two
# gates in permanent conflict, so Prettier does not touch them. (.gitleaks.toml,
# .yamllint-ignores and .markdownlintignore are NOT here: the canon seeds those
# create-if-absent and they are the repo's afterwards.)
